09,Taxi · Kaguraoka,09 Kouya,"43.740701, 142.3735135 (スープカリのお店 香屋 · 北海道旭川市神楽岡5条6丁目3-10)",OPEN MAP: https://maps.google.com/?q=43.740701%2C142.3735135. Soup curry specialist (スープカレーのお店 香屋 / Kouya). Walk-in only — no seats booked. Closed Tue/Wed. Hours often 11:00–19:30 LO 19:00 — confirm. Ticket-machine order. Taxi / car ~10 min from JR Asahikawa. Phone 0166-66-8120. Kaguraoka — not Midorigaoka. Not Okushiba.
